# =====================================================================
# Olhoff post-conference development baseline
# =====================================================================
# This tree carries ~1.5 GB, almost all of it immutable audit evidence
# (.mat / .npz binaries).  Policy:
#
#   * EVERY human-readable file is tracked, whatever its size.  These are
#     the sources, the audit reports, the run logs and the JSON/CSV
#     decision tables -- i.e. everything a refactor could damage.
#   * Binary artifacts BELOW 5 MB are tracked too.
#   * Binary artifacts AT OR ABOVE 5 MB are not tracked here; they are
#     covered file-by-file by EVIDENCE_MANIFEST.sha256, which IS tracked.
#     That manifest makes any accidental modification detectable even
#     though the bytes themselves live outside git.
#
# Nothing in this file is permission to modify audit evidence.  Audit
# directories are immutable records; see ARCHITECTURE_BASELINE.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------

.DS_Store
*.asv
*.m~
*.autosave

# Large binaries are enumerated in .gitignore.largebinaries, generated at
# baseline time and appended below by tools/baseline_gitignore.sh.
# Generated at baseline: binary artifacts >= 5 MB, excluded from git,
# covered instead by EVIDENCE_MANIFEST.sha256.
